  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "`box.black` (`PlaceBlackBox`, doc 06 §2.7, §3.1): places a black box, a function of kind `black_box`\ndrawn with the black-box symbol and its page geometry.\n\n- The page and the symbol copy must exist (the built-in black-box symbol `ew.gen.blackbox` draws the\n  outline, CPs and inner graphics of `box`). The representation is `{functions: [f], page, symbol, pos,\n  orient, rep_type, box}`; `rep_type` defaults to the symbol's and must be one the page type allows (as\n  `device.place`); `pos` must be on the page's connection grid.\n- `box` (`BoxSpec`, doc 03 §6): the outline, the device CPs with their function CP index, position\n  relative to the representation and direction, and the inner graphics. Absent: the function is drawn\n  by the symbol alone (a black-box function shown without its outline, as the CPX blocks of folios\n  203 … 206). Rejected: an outline of fewer than three points; two box CPs with the same index; a box CP\n  off the page's connection grid (with `orient` r0, the check is on `pos + cp.pos`).\n- `target` as in `device.place`, with the function's kind `black_box`: `new_device` creates a device\n  `{tag: {letter, counter: none}, kind}` and its main black-box function; `join_device` a black-box\n  function of the device with the given role (default auxiliary; a second main function is rejected by\n  EW-INV-002); `existing_function` another representation of an existing function, which must be of kind\n  `black_box` (else rejected with a hint to use `device.place`); `from_part` the device and every template\n  function of the part as in `device.place`, the representation drawing entry `template`, which must be a\n  black box; `new_terminal` is invalid here.\n- The black box's CPs are derived, not stored on the function: the part's CP pattern (the\n  template-origin rule of doc 03 §7) or the box CPs.\n\nContainment (a function placed inside the outline joins the box's device, doc 06 §2.7) is a gesture of\nthe place tool and is not done here. Outcome: the representation.",
  "properties": {
    "box": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/BoxSpec"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The outline, CPs and inner graphics; absent draws the symbol alone."
    },
    "orient": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/CmdOrient2",
      "default": "r0",
      "description": "The orientation."
    },
    "page": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/CmdUuid",
      "description": "The page."
    },
    "pos": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/CmdPt2",
      "description": "The insertion point."
    },
    "rep_type": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/RepType"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "description": "The representation type; default the symbol's."
    },
    "symbol": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/CmdUuid",
      "description": "The black-box symbol copy."
    },
    "target": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/PlaceTarget",
      "description": "Which device the black box belongs to."
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "page",
    "symbol",
    "pos",
    "target"
  ],
  "title": "box.black",
  "type": "object"
}
